      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "The Jacobian is [[2-16x-y,-x],[4y,-2+4x]], so at (0,0) it is diagonal with entries 2 and -2. MA graded all four submitted entries correct, including field-1 option 1. The eigenvalues are therefore 2 and -2; their opposite signs imply an unstable saddle. No MA answer evidence is captured for fields 5–7.",
