      "solution": {
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "reasoning": "Equilibria satisfy x(2-0.2x-y)=0 and y(x-3)=0. When y=0, x=0 or x=10. When y is nonzero, x=3 and y=2-0.2(3)=1.4. Thus the equilibria are (0,0), (10,0), and (3,1.4). No MA answer or grade is captured.",
